{
  "shots": [
    {
      "sentence": "I have lived alone for three years, but lately, the house has started mimicking my habits.",
      "search_term": "person sitting alone",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A person sitting alone in a dimly lit living room looking uneasy.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_1.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 4.082,
      "start": 0.171,
      "end": 4.253
    },
    {
      "sentence": "It began with the sound of a faucet dripping exactly three times, just as I finished brushing my teeth.",
      "search_term": "dripping faucet dark",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A close-up of a bathroom faucet dripping water in a dark room.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_2.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 4.803,
      "start": 4.734,
      "end": 9.537
    },
    {
      "sentence": "Then, I noticed the floorboards in the hallway creaking in rhythm with my own footsteps.",
      "search_term": "dark wooden hallway",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A dark, empty hallway with old wooden floorboards.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_3.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 3.762,
      "start": 9.997,
      "end": 13.759
    },
    {
      "sentence": "I dismissed it as the house settling, a common quirk of old Victorian timber.",
      "search_term": "old wooden stairs",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A shot of an old, dusty wooden staircase in a Victorian house.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_4.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 3.703,
      "start": 14.259,
      "end": 17.962
    },
    {
      "sentence": "That changed on Tuesday when I dropped a ceramic mug in the kitchen.",
      "search_term": "broken ceramic mug",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A ceramic mug shattering on a dark kitchen floor.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_5.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 2.661,
      "start": 18.362,
      "end": 21.023
    },
    {
      "sentence": "Before the shards could even settle, a second, identical crash echoed from the dark, unused attic above.",
      "search_term": "dark attic ceiling",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A dark, ominous attic ceiling with shadows.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_6.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 5.683,
      "start": 21.364,
      "end": 27.047
    },
    {
      "sentence": "My blood turned to ice as I stood perfectly still in the silence.",
      "search_term": "scared person face",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A close-up of a person's face looking terrified in the dark.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_7.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 3.022,
      "start": 27.407,
      "end": 30.429
    },
    {
      "sentence": "I didn't move, yet I heard a soft, rhythmic breathing coming from the ceiling directly over my head.",
      "search_term": "dark ceiling texture",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A low-angle shot looking up at a dark, textured ceiling.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_8.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 4.663,
      "start": 30.929,
      "end": 35.592
    },
    {
      "sentence": "It wasn't a draft; it was the synchronized rise and fall of lungs.",
      "search_term": "breathing chest dark",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A close-up of a chest rising and falling slowly in shadows.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_9.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 3.102,
      "start": 35.993,
      "end": 39.095
    },
    {
      "sentence": "Driven by a terrifying curiosity, I grabbed the heavy brass key to the attic door.",
      "search_term": "old brass key",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A hand holding an old, heavy brass key.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_10.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 4.503,
      "start": 39.575,
      "end": 44.078
    },
    {
      "sentence": "The stairs groaned under my weight as I climbed into the suffocating darkness.",
      "search_term": "climbing attic stairs",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A person walking up dark, creaky wooden attic stairs.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_11.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 3.662,
      "start": 44.518,
      "end": 48.18
    },
    {
      "sentence": "I clicked my flashlight on, bracing myself for a monster or a squatter.",
      "search_term": "flashlight beam dark",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A flashlight beam cutting through thick darkness in an attic.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_12.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 3.382,
      "start": 48.66,
      "end": 52.042
    },
    {
      "sentence": "The room was completely empty, save for a single, full-length mirror leaning against the far wall.",
      "search_term": "vintage floor mirror",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A tall, dusty mirror standing in an empty, dark room.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_13.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 4.582,
      "start": 52.422,
      "end": 57.004
    },
    {
      "sentence": "I stepped closer, my pulse hammering against my ribs like a trapped bird.",
      "search_term": "hand touching mirror",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A close-up of a person's hand reaching towards a mirror surface.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_14.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 3.302,
      "start": 57.404,
      "end": 60.706
    },
    {
      "sentence": "As I raised my hand to touch the glass, my reflection didn't move.",
      "search_term": "person looking mirror",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A person looking into a mirror with their reflection standing still.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_15.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 2.821,
      "start": 61.086,
      "end": 63.907
    },
    {
      "sentence": "It stood frozen, watching me with eyes that were no longer my own.",
      "search_term": "eyes in mirror",
      "media_type": "photo",
      "visual": "A close-up of a person's eyes reflecting in a mirror.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_16.jpg",
      "duration_seconds": 3.082,
      "start": 64.327,
      "end": 67.409
    },
    {
      "sentence": "Then, my reflection smiled, reached out, and firmly gripped my wrist from the other side.",
      "search_term": "hand grabbing wrist",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A hand emerging from a mirror grabbing a person's wrist.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_17.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 4.357,
      "start": 67.81,
      "end": 72.167
    },
    {
      "sentence": "It pulled me forward, and for the first time in three years, I realized I was finally home.",
      "search_term": "scary mirror reflection",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A person being pulled into a dark, distorted mirror reflection.",
